lood frequency"},{"text":"Design floods"},{"text":"Flood routing"},{"text":"Floodplain mapping"},{"text":"Flood-risk assessment"},{"text":"Urban flooding"},{"text":"Drainage systems"},{"text":"Flood-control structures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Groundwater"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aquifers"},{"text":"Porosity"},{"text":"Permeability"},{"text":"Darcy's law"},{"text":"Recharge"},{"text":"Well hydraulics"},{"text":"Groundwater flow"},{"text":"Groundwater contamination"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For advanced work, learn groundwater modelling tools such as MODFLOW."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Design, Modelling & Digital Water Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus on turning theoretical knowledge into engineering decisions."},{"type":"h","text":"GIS"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS concepts"},{"text":"Spatial analysis"},{"text":"Raster and vector data"},{"text":"DEMs"},{"text":"Watershed delineation"},{"text":"Land-use analysis"},{"text":"Flood mapping"},{"text":"Infrastructure mapping"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Hydrological & Hydraulic Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with tools such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HEC-HMS"},{"text":"HEC-RAS"},{"text":"SWAT"},{"text":"SWMM"},{"text":"MODFLOW"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the engineering workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Field / Satellite Data","Data Cleaning","Watershed / River Model","Model Calibration","Model Validation","Scenario Simulation","Engineering Design / Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"The important skill is understanding assumptions, calibration, validation and limitations, not simply producing model output."},{"type":"h","text":"CAD & Engineering Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Civil 3D"},{"text":"Hydraulic design drawings"},{"text":"Infrastructure layouts"},{"text":"Technical drafting"}]},{"type":"p","t